Open PMS - Dental
=================

Open PMS - Dental is a fork of Open Dental (c) Open Dental Software, Inc. and contributors, licensed under the GNU GPL v2. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Open Dental Software, Inc.

Origin
------
This program is based on the Open Dental source code, version 24.3.63.0, as
published under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your
option) any later version. Changes made in this fork are described in the
git history and in docs/decoupling-plan.md. Features from later Open Dental
versions are re-implemented from Open Dental's public documentation; no
Open Dental binaries are decompiled.

"Open Dental" is a name of Open Dental Software, Inc. It is used here only to
say where this program comes from. The program's namespaces, assemblies and
executable carry its own code name, OpenPmsDental (OpenPmsDental.exe). A few
names still read "Open Dental" because existing installations and databases
depend on them: database tables, columns and stored values, the
FreeDentalConfig.xml and OpenDentalServerConfig.xml file names, the Middle
Tier's web service names, and a number of internal type names such as
FormOpenDental. They do not mean this program is Open Dental's product.

